      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "The original Wan2.1 VAE is used unchanged under Apache-2.0.\nWeights: `Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged`, revision `123acf1cc74bccbb9bfff8ac1ee72edc08c2341d`, `split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`.\nConfiguration: `Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B-Diffusers`, revision `0fad780a534b6463e45facd96134c9f345acfa5b`, `vae/config.json`.\nOnly the installed filename follows the SDK VAE directory layout; tensor names, precision and payload bytes are unchanged. SHA-256 and size are recorded in `generation-defaults.json`.\n"
